9B876", "width": 640, "height": 640, "id": "9", "resolution": "640x640"}, {"url": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t15.5256-10/874604493_29794806346788387_9119025248596323776_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ig_cache_key=NDAxODY5OTEyOTMzNTU1NjYyOQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZmlyc3RfZnJhbWVfdGh1bWJuYWlsLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=71_H4h460r8Q7kNvwFmVnDb&_nc_oc=AdoUKVggYWCbr5NDQEN6C_6g6go4Ru7QqdoTKeNF5fK76T0oKgUnU2CchgMr2Ab3lSg&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=yN_-putbd5eNXQb-Upzwng&_nc_ss=79689&oh=00_AQSGmznwNm61OL_bSg_02Y9thJeaxDWnl6AYPSMIRwV5Cw&oe=6AE9B876", "width": 640, "height": 1136, "id": "10", "resolution": "640x1136"}], "comments": [{"author": "yasssku.dev", "author_id": "516647256", "id": "18129906508799212", "text": "Karpathy is right. RAG with 100 recall? no embeddings? you are not doing it right", "timestamp": 1793325777, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "isaac.the.miller", "author_id": "1806772535", "id": "17988580410083484", "text": "Awesome. Just built my harness with Jake\u2019s ICM Architecture as the foundation.", "timestamp": 1793324634, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "daniel.bodin", "author_id": "6659338", "id": "18111277097258502", "text": "Achieve folder consciousness - https://folder-consciousness.kindiris64.chatgpt.site", "timestamp": 1793318535, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "daniel.bodin", "author_id": "6659338", "id": "18131707967497071", "text": "@lostandlucky - folders and files - who knew \ud83d\ude02", "timestamp": 1793317582, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "omaraboomarr", "author_id": "284284058", "id": "18132998828504700", "text": "playbooks then skills from playbooks and store the information like how organized humans do plus excel sheets - doing it the old school way never failed humans neither will fail with ai if its setup properly and its easy to catch the mistakes and i consider it a system with a human fallback incase ai is down", "timestamp": 1793313557, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "tymothypeters", "author_id": "59901629176", "id": "18022708250948176", "text": "Lol\nI had a startup ~15 years ago, that pitched exact this idea and only used word2vec and some really fancy smart clustering algorithms.\nGot the eXist funding, tried to get it flying for a year, only some libraries were interested", "timestamp": 1793310153, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "k9services.com.au", "author_id": "3975175405", "id": "18098244635402359", "text": "@giorgoskano dude this comment made me snort laugh coffee out my nose\ud83e\udd23 @kem_glitch comes in as a domain expert, designs and tests it all so we can transparently see the numbers, is kind enough to share them AAAAAANNNNDDD even pumps up @lostandlucky in the process\u2026and then dude just chimes in with \u2018its BS because it conflicts with what i currently understand\u2019 \ud83e\udd37\u200d\u2642\ufe0f", "timestamp": 1793307223, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "ajmello", "author_id": "43211935", "id": "18125902384927660", "text": "I'm using QMD for this. Works very well for my use case", "timestamp": 1793306982, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "austinwarrendrums", "author_id": "173533428", "id": "17884216545626561", "text": "The fact you two have joined forces is the best thing to happen to the ai space on social media", "timestamp": 1793306530, "like_count": 4}, {"author": "tom_jones_the_real_one", "author_id": "1279315616", "id": "18129838861828698", "text": "I had an LLM wiki for about two weeks, and then I completely overhauled and switched everything to the ICM model. My token utilization plummeted drastically. The naming conventions aren't necessarily exactly the same, but the principles are all still there. I I think the intention of Carpathy was good. The execution and explanation were not great. I do appreciate the idea of capturing all of my thoughts. It was utilizing Obsidian for D&D planning for years and thinking everything in an old-school Unix modeling to help me bridge the gap of understanding between what was trying to be shared and then Jake's ICM presentation just made everything come together and click.", "timestamp": 1793305903, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "woaaaahhbipin", "author_id": "4679140635", "id": "18125643682697676", "text": "You\u2019re epic", "timestamp": 1793303561, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "stevie_hates_jazz", "author_id": "66774428306", "id": "17997288822023322", "text": "Grep works consistently better than nearly everything. ICM is great. Only issue is semantics", "timestamp": 1793300969, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "ex_sgt", "author_id": "5619235762", "id": "17914120179514462", "text": "@kem_glitch how about graphify?", "timestamp": 1793298918, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "rahulinc", "author_id": "252429955", "id": "17992470888120069", "text": "@lostandlucky would be puffed!!!", "timestamp": 1793298629, "like_count": 1}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfFSZDvN6oV/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfFSZDvN6oV/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfFSZDvN6oV", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "playlist": null, "playlist_index": null, "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t15.5256-10/874604493_29794806346788387_9119025248596323776_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ig_cache_key=NDAxODY5OTEyOTMzNTU1NjYyOQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZmlyc3RfZnJhbWVfdGh1bWJuYWlsLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=71_H4h460r8Q7kNvwFmVnDb&_nc_oc=AdoUKVggYWCbr5NDQEN6C_6g6go4Ru7QqdoTKeNF5fK76T0oKgUnU2CchgMr2Ab3lSg&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=yN_-putbd5eNXQb-Upzwng&_nc_ss=79689&oh=00_AQSGmznwNm61OL_bSg_02Y9thJeaxDWnl6AYPSMIRwV5Cw&oe=6AE9B876", "display_id": "DfFSZDvN6oV", "fulltitle": "Video by kem_glitch", "upload_date": "20261029", "release_year": null, "requested_subtitles": null, "_has_drm": null, "epoch": 179332582